---
// Section 07: Final CTA
---

<section class="relative w-full py-32 px-6 lg:px-12 overflow-hidden border-t border-white/[0.04]">
  <!-- Background Stadium Atmosphere Image -->
  <div class="absolute inset-0 z-0">
    <img 
      src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1514525253161-7a46d19cd819?auto=format&fit=crop&w=2000&q=85" 
      alt="Concert laser lights and cheering crowd" 
      class="w-full h-full object-cover object-center filter brightness-[0.25] contrast-125"
      loading="lazy"
    />
    <!-- Deep Magenta Radial Glow Overlay -->
    <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-b from-void-black via-deep-magenta/30 to-void-black"></div>
  </div>

  <div class="relative z-10 max-w-4xl mx-auto flex flex-col items-center text-center">
    <span 
      data-animate="reveal" 
      class="text-xs font-bold tracking-[0.25em] text-electric-magenta uppercase block mb-4"
    >
      YOUR NEXT UNFORGETTABLE NIGHT
    </span>

    <h2 
      data-animate="reveal" 
      class="delay-100 font-display text-5xl sm:text-7xl md:text-8xl text-soft-white leading-[0.95] tracking-wide mb-6"
    >
      DON'T JUST HEAR ABOUT IT. <br />
      <span class="text-transparent bg-clip-text bg-gradient-to-r from-soft-white via-soft-white to-electric-magenta">
        BE THERE.
      </span>
    </h2>

    <p 
      data-animate="reveal" 
      class="delay-200 text-base sm:text-lg text-muted-gray max-w-xl mb-10 font-normal leading-relaxed"
    >
      Ribuan penggemar musik telah mengamankan tiket konser impian mereka tanpa calo dan tanpa rasa khawatir. Ambil giliran Anda malam ini.
    </p>

    <div 
      data-animate="reveal" 
      class="delay-300 flex flex-col sm:flex-row items-center gap-4 w-full sm:w-auto"
    >
      <a 
        href="/events" 
        class="w-full sm:w-auto px-10 py-5 rounded-full bg-electric-magenta text-soft-white font-bold text-base tracking-wider hover:shadow-magenta-glow-lg transition-all duration-300 hover:scale-105 active:scale-95 text-center"
      >
        FIND YOUR EVENT
      </a>
      <a 
        href="/organizer" 
        class="w-full sm:w-auto px-8 py-5 rounded-full bg-dark-plum/80 border border-white/15 text-soft-white font-semibold text-base tracking-wide hover:bg-white/10 transition-all duration-300 text-center"
      >
        CREATE AN EVENT
      </a>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
